# Credits

FinnOS is built by the FinnOS contributors ([LICENSE](LICENSE)) on top of open-source
software, protocols, fonts, and icons. For full legal license texts and
notices, see [NOTICE](NOTICE).

## Typography & Icons
- **Fixel Display** — MacPaw & AlfaBravo (`SIL Open Font License 1.1`)
- **HugeIcons** — Hugeicons (`MIT`, source for `display.svg` and `moon.svg`)
- **DejaVu** and **Google Noto** (`ttf-dejavu`, `noto-fonts`, `noto-fonts-cjk`, `noto-fonts-emoji`) — fallback and multi-script system fonts

## Display, Compositor & UI Stack
- **Wayland** & **wayland-protocols** — Freedesktop / Wayland project
- **wlroots** — wlroots contributors (the compositor foundation for `finn-comp`)
- **Qt 6** — The Qt Company and Qt contributors (`QtCore`, `QtGui`, `QtWidgets`, `QtSvg`, `QtDBus`, `QtNetwork`, `QtWebEngine`)
- **LayerShellQt** — KDE contributors
- **Mesa**, **libdrm**, **libinput**, **seatd**, **libxkbcommon**, **pixman**, **Xwayland**
- **FreeType**, **Fontconfig**, **libwebp**

## Base System, Kernel & Services
- **Linux kernel** — Linus Torvalds and kernel contributors
- **systemd** — systemd contributors
- **Arch Linux** & **Arch Linux ARM** — base packages, `pacman`, `archiso`, and `arch-install-scripts`
- **Plymouth** — boot splash infrastructure
- **GRUB** & **Syslinux** — bootloaders
- **PipeWire** & **WirePlumber** — audio stack
- **NetworkManager**, **wpa_supplicant**, **BlueZ**, **UPower** — connectivity & hardware services
- **Flatpak**, **xdg-desktop-portal**, **xdg-desktop-portal-wlr** — Linux app compatibility
- **Wine**, **Winetricks**, **Wine Mono**, **Wine Gecko** — Windows app compatibility (`x86_64`)

## Development & VM Tooling
- **Lima** & **QEMU** — Apple Silicon `aarch64` development VM environment
